  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Youth Building a Culture of Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Centro Jurdico Popular (CJP) will provide 915 young Nicaraguans from rural communities in five municipalities of Matagalpa training in citizenship conflict resolution communication and advocacy. It will also encourage at-risk youths to launch or strengthen existing small businesses by providing loans and technical assistance. The Grant will benefit another 3120 people indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
